  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prosecution Expert</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Uts&#xe4;nd r&#xe5;dgivande &#xe5;klagarexpert</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Placering av &#xe5;klagarexpert som genom fr&#xe4;mst r&#xe5;dgivning och tr&#xe4;ning syftar till att st&#xe4;rka Ukrainas r&#xe4;ttsstat, d&#xe5; en fungerande r&#xe4;ttsstat &#xe4;r en&#xa0; f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttning f&#xf6;r en demokratisk och inkluderande samh&#xe4;llsstyrning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The placement of a prosecutor&apos;s expert who, through advice and training, aims to strengthen Ukraine&apos;s rule of law, as a functioning rule of law is a prerequisite for democratic and inclusive governance</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Att bidra till att st&#xe4;rka och st&#xf6;dja hela r&#xe4;ttskedjan i Ukraina. Bidra med en &#xe5;klagare i EU:s r&#xe5;dgivande insats i Ukraina.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to strengthening and supporting the entire justice chain in Ukraine. To contribute with an prosecutor in the advisory efforts on the part of the Europen Union.</narrative>
  </description>
